    <string name="policy_import_warning">Only supported exact blocking rules are accepted. Existing IDs and revisions are kept. New rules map to this Android profile and remain inactive until individual review and fresh consent. No VPN starts. Missing identities, signer mismatches and redacted targets cannot activate. Disabled rules remain disabled.</string>
