    <string name="policy_review_warning">Confirm this exact app, target and signing identity. Activation requires the installed app to have the same signer and a single-package UID in this profile. This records fresh consent. Enabled rules apply when WAYD runs; disabled rules stay disabled. A whole-app target blocks all supported connections. Remove any unwanted rule in Controls.</string>
