    <string name="routing_scope">Optional Mihomo v1.19.33 routing for explicitly selected apps. Initial Clash subset: SOCKS5 / HTTP CONNECT, static select groups (first entry), PROCESS-NAME, DOMAIN, DOMAIN-SUFFIX, IP-CIDR / IP-CIDR6 and MATCH. Proxy server addresses must be numeric IPs. Unsupported options are rejected. WAYD blocks always win; proxy failure never falls back to Direct.</string>
    <string name="routing_dns">DNS stays on the underlying network unless an attributable selected flow is explicitly routed. No fake IP, encrypted DNS or DNS leak protection. Unknown/shared-UID and unselected apps use Direct. IPv6 follows WAYD’s existing coverage. No subscriptions, health probes or automatic downloads.</string>
